{"parentUuid":"2b2644f9-f431-4eed-bbe0-b4689f73cf83","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_vrtx_01NbGzHSxLumVhHoAbAeXygP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是 Claude Code CLI 的 Rust 重写版本（orbcode），目标是与 TypeScript 版本保持字节级兼容。\n\n主要特点：\n- **运行时**: 原生二进制，Rust 2024 edition，`scripts/check.sh` 必须零错误\n- **入口**: `cli/src/main.rs` → `AppServer`（clap 定义子命令，无子命令时进入 TUI）\n- **核心循环**: `core/src/session_manager/` 与 `core/src/agent_loop/` 驱动对话，TUI 用 ratatui 渲染\n- **多 provider**: 除 Anthropic 直连外，还有 OpenAI 等流式 HTTP provider，统一收在 `model-provider`\n- **工具系统**: `ToolRegistry::foundation()` 声明内置工具（文件、Shell、Agent、Web、MCP 等）及其权限要求\n- **Workspace**: 14 个 crate，按依赖 DAG 分层（protocol → config → ... → cli）\n- **兼容性**: JSONL transcript、settings 分层、CLI flag、stream-json 都由 golden fixture 固定\n- **权限体系**: allow/deny 规则用 tree-sitter-bash 解析命令结构，MCP 另有 per-server trust\n\n当前版本 0.0.1，主分支 `main` 干净。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":50381,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":540,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":50381},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"97f755e5-6765-4206-9201-115ed0c78929","timestamp":"2026-05-29T02:54:36.047Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/dev/github/orbcode","sessionId":"ef9ef158-1c3e-4b3d-bc04-c9d3aa0f1bc9","version":"2.6.0","gitBranch":"main"}
